    "updated_at": "2017-07-10T12:11:44Z",
    "body": "I've added use counters in Blink. Apparently, document.domain is set when the origin has the default port on 0.009705% of page loads, and with a non-default port for 0.000005% of page loads.\r\n\r\nNote that I'd be interested in implementing this :)",
