    "created_at": "2018-05-02T16:58:21Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-05-02T16:58:21Z",
    "body": "HSTS's behavior is another consideration here -- enforcing HSTS Policy effectively uses [\"is a registrable domain suffix of or is equal to\"](https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc6797#section-8.2) matching, regardless of the presence of an explicit port.  see also: https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc6797#section-8.3 and https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc6797#appendix-A item 6. \r\n\r\nSee also: [JacksonBarth2008] http://seclab.stanford.edu/websec/origins/fgo.pdf",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
    "reactions": {
      "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/whatwg/html/issues/comments/386047592/reactions",
